{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933570/extras/01753d6036905ec6a26fe0addf1f44d0.poster.avif?t=1758235800\" width=1170 height=601 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933570/extras/01753d6036905ec6a26fe0addf1f44d0.webm?t=1758235800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dice Card Heroes, every card features its own dice. Battle against many fantastic creatures across 3 chapters. Upgrade your cards, build countless synergies and find mighty weapons to shape your playstyle. There is only one goal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the hero, slay the dragon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933570/extras/6d15777d755a987b61ead5e062e92f7c.avif?t=1758235800\" width=340 height=120 /></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a deck but roll your dice</strong>. Every card features a unique dice that is rolled during combat. Dice let you attack, buff and much more. Cards can also be upgraded with runestones that make every dice even more unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control your luck</strong>. In combat you draw 5 cards every turn and roll their dice. You can play every dice, but you only have a limited amount of luck to reroll your them. Every dice also features focus sides, these allow you to use the unique abilities of your hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your build</strong>. Weapons and items let you build powerful synergies with your dice. Maybe you will stack powerful buffs to destroy the enemy with one attack as the knight or gather countless arrows to rain down attacks as the bandit.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933570/extras/e24495bda59c93e9cd13f27a6064e75e.poster.avif?t=1758235800\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933570/extras/e24495bda59c93e9cd13f27a6064e75e.webm?t=1758235800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933570/extras/e24495bda59c93e9cd13f27a6064e75e.mp4?t=1758235800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933570/extras/957b074db23888775fd7e804bca95cfa.avif?t=1758235800\" width=340 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The first\u00a0</strong>hero with their own cards, abilities and starting weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>50\u00a0</strong>unique cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first <strong>2</strong> chapters with over <strong>20</strong> unique enemy encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>40\u00a0</strong>different items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>10\u00a0</strong>different weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39